# publication_runs: generate_slurm.py's fully machine-generated output
# (configs/, logs/, rendered sbatch scripts, submitted_jobs.tsv) -- never
# hand-edited, regenerated per run, path-specific to whichever cluster ran it.
# NOT publication_runs/*/slurm/ -- that also matches publication_runs/common/
# slurm/, which is real tracked source (list_job_status.py, sbatch_blocks.py,
# etc.), not generated output. List each dataset's own slurm/ explicitly.
